autoware-localrepo-1-5-0 (1.5.0-3ubuntu2204sbsa) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Stop bundling autoware-data-1-5-0 (1.8 GB of ML models). autoware-full
    now pulls autoware-model-downloader-1-5-0; run
    autoware-download-models-1-5-0 as your own user to fetch the models into
    ~/autoware_data.
  * autoware-theme-1-5-0 1.5.0-2: the theme script is now
    apply-autoware-theme-1-5-0, so other Autoware versions can be installed
    beside this one.

